  "prompt": "Of the resent copies, how many had a promotion and how many had none? This table may hold errors. Two lines are copies of one order line when order_id, product_id, quantity, unit_price_eur, promo_id and line_discount_eur all match, with a missing promo_id matching a missing one; every line beyond the first of such a set is a resent copy. A copy had a promotion when its promo_id is not missing. Return two columns, in this order: n_with_promo and n_without_promo. The result is a single row. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "n_with_promo",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "n_without_promo",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
